<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116465" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span> (on the accent v.
			Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.214
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a horned</i> or
				<i>eared owl,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δ᾽ ὦτος . . , περὶ τὰ ὦτα πτερύγια
					ἔχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					597b21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.961e
			</span></i>, v.l. ib.<i><span class="en">
				52b
			</span></i>: <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.390d
			</span></i> appears to identify it with the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠτίς,</span> but this is due to interpolation.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>an easily deceived person, booby,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Com.Adesp.
				47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.Dion.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				336
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦτα: τὰ μὴ στρογγύλα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦτοι λίθοι</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.823.66
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Troezen</span>) is wrongly read, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧ</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
